[{"title":"竞渡棹歌 其七","author":"黄公绍","text":"棹如飞，棹如飞，水中万鼓起潜螭。\n最是玉堂堂上好，跃来夺锦看吴儿。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8032,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"踏莎行 木樨","author":"黄公绍","text":"蟾苑萧疏，云岩芳馥。\n仙娥寄种来溪曲。\n晓烟薰上古龙涎，西风展破黄金粟。\n庾岭未梅，陶园休菊。\n天教占取清香独。\n胆瓶枕畔两三枝，梦回疑在瑶台宿。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8033,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"一春 其二","author":"黄庚","text":"花心醉日蝶先觉，柳眼窥春莺未知。\n景物繁华易凋谢，一春消得几番诗。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8034,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"一春","author":"黄庚","text":"新绿园林雨过时，黄鹂无语恨春归。\n杨花怕逐东风去，搭住阑干不肯飞。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8035,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"九日感怀","author":"黄庚","text":"新橙初试蟹螯肥，一曲清歌酒一卮。\n料得故园秋正好，黄花应怪客归迟。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8036,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"子胥庙","author":"黄庚","text":"伍相祠前云气昏，奔吴心事与谁论。\n怒涛夜半翻江月，疑是忠臣一片魂。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8037,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"山村","author":"黄庚","text":"小小荆扉傍水开，竹桥分路入苍苔。\n呼童扫去阶前叶，恐有诗人踏月来。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8038,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"山中","author":"黄庚","text":"万壑松声撼翠微，夜寒风露湿人衣。\n山翁踏月巡幽径，竹里笼开鹤未归。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8039,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"山中秋夜","author":"黄庚","text":"石床弹月鹤听琴，玉宇凝秋绝点尘。\n万里无云银汉淡，一天风露湿星辰。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8040,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"中秋对月","author":"黄庚","text":"十分蟾影照人间，一片山河古影寒。\n惆怅年年今夜月，人生能得几回看。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8041,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"书灯","author":"黄庚","text":"书幌低垂风不来，兰膏花暖夜深开。\n剔残犹有馀光在，一点丹心未肯灰。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8042,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"书怀","author":"黄庚","text":"万卷诗书千古事，一灯窗火十年心。\n功名梦断身无用，闲补离骚学楚吟。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8043,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"书馆即事","author":"黄庚","text":"烟拖野色入书窗，一畈平田隔草塘。\n暮雨初收新水满，藕花香杂稻花香。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8044,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孔明高卧图","author":"黄庚","text":"未用胸中八阵兵，草庐高卧掩柴扃。\n当时不见刘玄德，谁识先生是将星。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8045,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"木芙蓉","author":"黄庚","text":"芙蓉一带绕池塘，万绿丛中簇艳妆。\n错认园林春富贵，不知叶底有风霜。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8046,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"水仙花","author":"黄庚","text":"冰魂月魄水精神，翠袂凌波湿楚云。\n雪后清闲谁是侣，汨罗江上伴湘君。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8047,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"王荆公庙","author":"黄庚","text":"遗像巍然占古祠，区区土偶亦冠緌。\n无言似想青苗策，面目犹如执拗时。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8048,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"见雁有怀","author":"黄庚","text":"满眼西风忆故庐，亲朋音问久相疏。\n年年江上无情雁，只带秋来不带书。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8049,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"东山谢太傅祠蔷薇台","author":"黄庚","text":"围棋别墅却秦军，千载功名一窖尘。\n今日江山非晋有，荒祠花木为谁春。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8050,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"仙姑对奕图","author":"黄庚","text":"碧玉花冠素锦裳，对拈棋子费思量。\n终年不下神仙著，想是蓬莱日月长。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8051,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"半轩疏雨","author":"黄庚","text":"檐前数点弄晴光，浥露庭花枕簟香。\n池草梦回诗思杳，吟窗分得一边凉。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8052,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"对菊","author":"黄庚","text":"菊似灵均带楚愁，餐英人去思悠悠。\n西风篱落甘清苦，不爱春光只爱秋。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8053,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"对菊","author":"黄庚","text":"春花能得几时红，万树繁华转眼空。\n黄菊虽黄偏耐久，西风雅淡似东风。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8054,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"田家","author":"黄庚","text":"流水小桥江路景，疏篱矮屋野人家。\n田园空阔无桃李，一段春光属菜花。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8055,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"龙江无杜鹃","author":"黄庚","text":"客里春残又一年，落花满地草连天。\n缘何不动归与兴，祇为龙江无杜鹃。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8056,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"伤春","author":"黄庚","text":"园林芳事已阑珊，梅未生仁笋未竿。\n堤上柳棉风脱尽，绿阴应在雨中寒。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8057,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"伤春","author":"黄庚","text":"东皇别我太匆匆，急景相催鬓已翁。\n杜宇一声花结局，人生消得几春风。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8058,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"杂咏 其七","author":"黄庚","text":"囊底诗成无卖处，床头金尽已多时。\n元龙豪气依然在，惯守清贫岂足悲。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8059,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"杂咏 其五","author":"黄庚","text":"新绿园林微雨后，落红庭院夕阳时。\n一声杜宇催春去，贪睡棠妃未必知。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8060,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"杂咏 其二","author":"黄庚","text":"人非陶令空看菊，诗不林逋漫咏梅。\n晋宋后来爱花者，输他高节与高才。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8061,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"杂咏 其一","author":"黄庚","text":"柳嫌暮雨莺声涩，花怯东风蝶梦寒。\n偶忆故园春色好，他乡花柳带愁看。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8062,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"杂咏","author":"黄庚","text":"地多种竹堪容鹤，池不栽莲恐碍鱼。\n小径荒苔人不到，闭门閒学换鹅书。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8063,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"杂咏 其六","author":"黄庚","text":"持螯已饱团脐蟹，砟脍犹思巨口鲈。\n风物秋来多感慨，天寒酒醒客心孤。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8064,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"杂咏 其八","author":"黄庚","text":"人无气节何足道，腹有诗书自不同。\n实学真才谁具眼，江湖难遇杜司空。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8065,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"杂咏 其四","author":"黄庚","text":"稚柳已回春暖意，残梅犹结岁寒心。\n百年身世诗中老，好景难消几度吟。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8066,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"杂咏 其三","author":"黄庚","text":"天外斜阳犹在树，林间宿鸟已归巢。\n黄昏莫把柴门掩，恐有诗人带月敲。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8067,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"江上","author":"黄庚","text":"江上支筇眼界宽，夕阳影里水云寒。\n凭谁说与閒鸥鹭，借我渔矶把钓竿。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8068,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"江村","author":"黄庚","text":"极目江天一望赊，寒烟漠漠日西斜。\n十分秋色无人管，半属芦花半蓼花。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8069,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"江村即事","author":"黄庚","text":"江村暝色渐凄迷，数点残鸦杂雁飞。\n雁宿芦花鸦宿树，各分一半夕阳归。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8070,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"江景","author":"黄庚","text":"寒生雁背天将雪，冷入鱼鳃水欲冰。\n钓艇归来江路暝，舟人分火点渔灯。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8071,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"池荷","author":"黄庚","text":"红藕花多映碧阑，秋风才起易彫残。\n池塘一段荣枯事，都被沙鸥冷眼看。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8072,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"竹林夏日","author":"黄庚","text":"不受炎光玉万竿，仙林便作晋林看。\n此君长带冰霜气，醉卧绿阴诗梦寒。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8073,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"舟次九山","author":"黄庚","text":"水云尽处列奇峰，螺髻参差杳霭中。\n江岸维舟看不了，烟岚分碧入疏篷。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8074,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"西山韩太师坟","author":"黄庚","text":"古墓年深草树荒，石人石马卧斜阳。\n争如湖上逋仙冢，诗骨埋云万古香。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8075,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"西湖行春","author":"黄庚","text":"画船无复沸笙歌，湖水年年自碧波。\n回首苏公堤上柳，绿阴不似旧时多。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8076,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"论诗","author":"黄庚","text":"三百馀篇岂苦思，个中妙处少人知。\n籁鸣机动何容力，才涉推敲不是诗。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8077,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"过曹娥庙","author":"黄庚","text":"细雨满山眉黛敛，怒涛千古哭声寒。\n须知此庙关风教，莫作寻常神女看。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8078,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"问菊","author":"黄庚","text":"山冈独立对秋光，一袖西风两屐霜。\n笑倚东篱问寒菊，自渊明后几番香。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8079,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"即事","author":"黄庚","text":"春晴无处不繁华，多少游人逐钿车。\n尽道东风花柳好，谁知生意在桑麻。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8080,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"即景","author":"黄庚","text":"篱落西风野老家，闲看景物感年华。\n柳衰荷败芙蓉死，交割秋光与菊花。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8081,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"吟边","author":"黄庚","text":"落尽荼蘼燕未归，小园寂寂掩柴扉。\n吟边正苦无诗料，风递杨花扑客衣。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8082,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"听雨","author":"黄庚","text":"老来已觉此身闲，近日唐诗亦懒看。\n半榻白云眠听雨，一窗帘影隔春寒。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8083,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"床屏墨竹","author":"黄庚","text":"淇澳新梢笔下分，枕屏墨晕点寒云。\n诗人纸帐眠清夜，不梦梅花梦此君。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8084,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"怀友","author":"黄庚","text":"听雨思君泪欲流，檐声滴老鬓边秋。\n何时过我晴窗下，共话思君听雨愁。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8085,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"炀帝行宫","author":"黄庚","text":"彩凤楼前汴水流，君王不复锦帆游。\n长堤旧日青青柳，曾带春风拂御舟。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8086,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"芭蕉","author":"黄庚","text":"翠叶离披傍竹林，几年雨露受恩深。\n绿章封事今无用，空对西风抱赤心。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8087,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"花柳","author":"黄庚","text":"花半睡时分蝶梦，柳三眠处足莺声。\n谁知花柳无情物，添个蝶莺便有情。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8088,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和李蓝溪梅花韵 其一","author":"黄庚","text":"孤山别后有谁怜，踏雪看花又一年。\n几度相思空夜月，角声吹恨不成眠。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8089,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和李蓝溪梅花韵 其二","author":"黄庚","text":"觅句逋仙琢肺肝，声名千古冠吟坛。\n一诗香尽西湖水，白雪阳春和者难。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8090,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和李蓝溪梅花韵 其四","author":"黄庚","text":"南枝开遍北枝开，祗恐飞香落砌苔。\n踏雪诗人应癖好，杖藜日日为诗来。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8091,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"和靖墓","author":"黄庚","text":"木落孤山墓草荒，梅花千古带诗香。\n吟魂仙去谁招得，独鹤一声幽恨长。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8092,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"夜窗","author":"黄庚","text":"香篆烟销夜已阑，砚池冰结漏声寒。\n梅花悬影书窗上，应待诗人带月看。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8093,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"夜景","author":"黄庚","text":"一池清浸藕花月，午夜凉生菰叶风。\n风月无边诗兴动，品题收拾锦囊中。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8094,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"明妃 其一","author":"黄庚","text":"和戎何惜遣蛾眉，悔恨徒然杀画师。\n汉主深恩如可报，安身死虏亦无辞。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8095,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"明妃 其二","author":"黄庚","text":"一函香骨埋沙漠，魂魄多应绕汉庭。\n惟有春风知此恨，年年吹拂草痕青。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8096,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"明皇杨妃图","author":"黄庚","text":"君王拥袖倚娇容，指法相同曲亦同。\n料想马嵬千古恨，当年已寓笛声中。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8097,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"明皇按乐图","author":"黄庚","text":"一曲霓裳舞太真，谁知鼙鼓动胡尘。\n当时若按周姬乐，治世音中无乱人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8098,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"折柳","author":"黄庚","text":"阳关一曲灞桥春，垂绿阴中别恨新。\n漫折青丝千万缕，多应绊不住行人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8099,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"枕边瓶桂","author":"黄庚","text":"岩桂花开风露天，一枝折向枕屏边。\n清香重透诗人骨，半榻眠秋梦亦仙。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8100,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"林高士隐居","author":"黄庚","text":"家住西湖深更深，古松阴里礼茅君。\n白猿攀树藤花落，点破岩前一地云。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8101,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"虎丘阻雨","author":"黄庚","text":"石阑浸碧剑池空，池外秋声万壑风。\n人倚僧窗看风雨，亭亭塔影有无中。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8102,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"诗穷","author":"黄庚","text":"风愁月恨属诗翁，终日推敲句未工。\n何苦辛勤学郊岛，呕心博得一生穷。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8103,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"述怀","author":"黄庚","text":"故乡迢递几时还，目断长江杳渺间。\n一雁飞边天万里，白云多处是青山。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8104,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"采莲女","author":"黄庚","text":"越女兰舟泛绿漪，采莲花露湿红衣。\n万荷影里歌声过，惊起鸳鸯贴水飞。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8105,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"金陵怀古","author":"黄庚","text":"六宫禾黍千年恨，一片江山万古情。\n明月不关兴废事，夜深还照石头城。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8106,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"雨过","author":"黄庚","text":"雨过山头云气湿，潮生渡口岸痕深。\n一声短笛斜阳外，知有渔舟泊柳阴。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8107,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"临平泊舟","author":"黄庚","text":"客舟系缆柳阴傍，湖影侵篷夜气凉。\n万顷波光摇月碎，一天风露藕花香。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8108,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}}]